  "certified_type": {
    "category": "Automatic catchweigher",
    "type_designations": ["CWS™ Loadpin"],
    "module_designation": null,
    "description": "The CWS™ Loadpin is an automatic catchweigher designed to weigh containers statically with no operator intervention. The instrument comprises digital load cells, an interface unit and a control and display unit. The load cells and electronics are permanently installed on the spreader of container handlers; weight values are transmitted via the interface unit to the display unit (typically in the operator's cab) and to the Terminal Operating System (TOS). Enclosures are aluminium; the display unit has an LCD display and 8 keys (6 functional control keys, 2 navigation keys). Interfaces: RS 232 / RS 422 / RS 485, CANBUS, Ethernet, Wifi. Devices: semi-automatic zero-setting (≤ 4% Max) via user interface or TOS, long term storage device, display and storage of individual and total weights. Securing: seal on electronics enclosures, indelible load cell serial numbers on data plate, tamper-evident label with Config Version counter."
